# play logs/elsewhere ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Logs screen proposed for slice 1,$
# inferred from v0.3.2 and origin/main, read from a simulated$
# host by the gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s to build. It only$
# reads: no plan, no y/N, no journal. No pager runs: an item$
# says what it would run. Nothing on this machine changes: every$
# command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: logs/elsewhere$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less installed. hardn.yml$
# says logFile: /srv/log/hardn.log, where nothing writes. The$
# screen reads the file hardn writes and says so; origin/main$
# reads logFile, not what main() opens (P-18; config.go:324).$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 601 bytes$
   -  hardn.yml's logFile, /srv/log/hardn.log, isn't used$
$
# Last 3 of 10 lines -------------------------------------------$
$
      2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      | exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 INFO: Using configuration from:$
      | /etc/hardn/hardn.yml$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 SUCCESS: debian trixie detected$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Open                 The whole log in less$
   2) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

